      {
        "id": 241593,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-12-08T13:17:15.626Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Very yes from me.</p>\n<p>They seem to finally be back to in-person, one-table play, which means going back to the occasional one-shot may also be possible.</p>\n<p>And even if it’s not, Exandria Unlimited worked out, right?</p>\n<p>Just tell them to also record the character creation, because character creation is so much fun. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-12-08T13:17:15.626Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
